OL,3,GNEWSACommunication device for autistic 
OL,4,Ason goes global                        
OL,6,FAn autistic boy has inspired his       
OL,7,Fparent's global business creating and  
OL,8,Fselling 3D-printed communication tags. 
OL,10,FSophie Haynes started making plastic   
OL,11,Ftags featuring everyday words, actions 
OL,12,Fand emotions at home in Northampton in 
OL,13,Fearly 2025, to help her son            
OL,14,Fcommunicate.                           
OL,16,FShe and her husband Tom now sell them  
OL,17,Fto families, schools and healthcare    
OL,18,Fsettings across the UK and in the US,  
OL,19,FEurope and Australia.                  
