OL,3,GNEWSACommunication device for autistic 
OL,4,Ason goes global                        
OL,6,F"To know that we are helping thousands 
OL,7,Fof people across the world is one of   
OL,8,Fthe most amazing things I've ever done 
OL,9,Fin my life," Sophie said.              
